{
    "title": "Family Tracker by Phone Number",
    "description": "Isn't it true that we worry for our kids and want to know where they are? But we can't always be around them. In a situation like this, a safe and free family locator app could come in handy. So why not try this Family locator - GPS location tracker app: FindU to find my kids through numbers?\r\n\r\nBy using this free family location tracker app, you can easily track your kids' location and share phone location, enhancing love & security among your family members.\r\n\r\nFamily Locator - GPS location tracker app: FindU, easy to find my kids\r\n\ud83d\udd0ePhone Tracker by number free, know where they are all the time\r\n\ud83d\udccdFind my phone on the maps, and find the shortest route\r\n\ud83d\udc6bShare real-time location to stay in touch\r\n\ud83d\udc6aEnsure the life 360 safety of your kids with family locator app\r\n\ud83c\udd98Respond to SOS signal rapidly when someone gets into trouble\r\n\ud83d\udd5bApp usage: Find out how much time your kids spend using apps on their phones. Parental control has never been this easy\r\n\r\nAll you can do with the Family Locator App - free family location tracker App:\r\n\ud83e\uddd0Track kid\u2019s mobile number location for free.\r\n\ud83e\uddedFind kid location on the maps and track their real-time phone location.\r\n\ud83c\udfc3Find my kids, find my phone with the shortest route planned by the family locator app.\r\n\ud83d\udc68\ud83d\udc69\ud83d\udc67\ud83d\udc66Family link add up to 4 people at a time, create your private groups\r\n\r\nThree easy steps to start Family Locator - the location tracker app: FindU\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Open the family locator, the location tracker app\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Allow location permissions (Don worry, the phone tracker app won't collect or share your personal information)\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Get or receive invitation code to create a family link\r\n\r\n\u2b50If you are the host (Parents)\r\n- Family tracker app will give you a code for the family link\r\n- Enter the code on the mobile phone you want to track\r\n- Click Find the Phone on the family locator app, let the location tracker app work on the background\r\n\r\n\u2b50If you are the invited member (kids)\r\n- Receive a code from your parents\r\n- Enter the code on your mobile phone\r\n- Life360 locator finder is ready to guard you!\r\n\r\nCautions:\r\n- Please note, FindU: Phone Tracker by Number free can only be used to track kids\u2019 location. Do not use it to track spouse or others even with their consent\r\n- Make sure Internet is connected when using Family Locator App, also phone tracker by number, mobile number tracker. If the Internet signal is weak, family tracker app can't track location accurately.\r\n- Before use this phone tracker app, please open Google Maps. Family tracker provides tracking service and display the movements on Google maps.\r\n- If one of you close family locator app, GPS location & phone location can't be found. If you want to safeguard your kids and know where they are, you should tell them family GPS tracker: FindU is used for their life 360 security and they should keep family tracker running background.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Isn&#39;t it true that we worry for our kids and want to know where they are? But we can&#39;t always be around them. In a situation like this, a safe and free family locator app could come in handy. So why not try this Family locator - GPS location tracker app: FindU to find my kids through numbers?<br><br>By using this free family location tracker app, you can easily track your kids&#39; location and share phone location, enhancing love &amp; security among your family members.<br><br>Family Locator - GPS location tracker app: FindU, easy to find my kids<br>\ud83d\udd0ePhone Tracker by number free, know where they are all the time<br>\ud83d\udccdFind my phone on the maps, and find the shortest route<br>\ud83d\udc6bShare real-time location to stay in touch<br>\ud83d\udc6aEnsure the life 360 safety of your kids with family locator app<br>\ud83c\udd98Respond to SOS signal rapidly when someone gets into trouble<br>\ud83d\udd5bApp usage: Find out how much time your kids spend using apps on their phones. Parental control has never been this easy<br><br>All you can do with the Family Locator App - free family location tracker App:<br>\ud83e\uddd0Track kid\u2019s mobile number location for free.<br>\ud83e\uddedFind kid location on the maps and track their real-time phone location.<br>\ud83c\udfc3Find my kids, find my phone with the shortest route planned by the family locator app.<br>\ud83d\udc68\ud83d\udc69\ud83d\udc67\ud83d\udc66Family link add up to 4 people at a time, create your private groups<br><br>Three easy steps to start Family Locator - the location tracker app: FindU<br>\u2714\ufe0f Open the family locator, the location tracker app<br>\u2714\ufe0f Allow location permissions (Don worry, the phone tracker app won&#39;t collect or share your personal information)<br>\u2714\ufe0f Get or receive invitation code to create a family link<br><br>\u2b50If you are the host (Parents)<br>- Family tracker app will give you a code for the family link<br>- Enter the code on the mobile phone you want to track<br>- Click Find the Phone on the family locator app, let the location tracker app work on the background<br><br>\u2b50If you are the invited member (kids)<br>- Receive a code from your parents<br>- Enter the code on your mobile phone<br>- Life360 locator finder is ready to guard you!<br><br>Cautions:<br>- Please note, FindU: Phone Tracker by Number free can only be used to track kids\u2019 location. Do not use it to track spouse or others even with their consent<br>- Make sure Internet is connected when using Family Locator App, also phone tracker by number, mobile number tracker. If the Internet signal is weak, family tracker app can&#39;t track location accurately.<br>- Before use this phone tracker app, please open Google Maps. Family tracker provides tracking service and display the movements on Google maps.<br>- If one of you close family locator app, GPS location &amp; phone location can&#39;t be found. If you want to safeguard your kids and know where they are, you should tell them family GPS tracker: FindU is used for their life 360 security and they should keep family tracker running background.",
